- 97 files: Commons Clause
- 62 files: GPL-2.0 (flawfinder)
- 11 files: shares patterns or wording with a semgrep-rules rule (Semgrep Rules License)
- 6 files: MIT header inside a folder the upstream README assigns another license
- 5 files: GitLab EE license

